      "value": "Facing the same problem, from logs it seems to happen after it triggered a NullReferenceException, restarting vrchat seems to fix it for awhile.\n\nSeems to happen randomly when someone joins the world?\n\nLog excerpt:\n\n2025.07.25 18:18:35 Debug      -  [Behaviour] Avatar is Ready, Initializing\n\n2025.07.25 18:18:35 Debug      -  Measure Human Avatar Avatar isRemeasure:False\n\n2025.07.25 18:18:35 Debug      -  [Behaviour] Initialize ThreePoint Avatar VRCPlayer[Remote] 40 False 8\n\n2025.07.25 18:18:41 Debug      -  Grabbing - Chain:10561329667512658303 Bone:11\n\n2025.07.25 18:18:49 Debug      -  Grabbing - Chain:10705447054611769727 Bone:2\n\n2025.07.25 18:19:10 Error      -  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\nSystem.NullReferenceException: Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.PhysBoneManager.OutputFullDebug () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.PhysBoneManager.ScheduleExecutionJob (Unity.Jobs.JobHandle dependsOn) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.VRCAvatarDynamicsScheduler.PreScheduleAvatarDynamics (System.Boolean finalizeImmediately) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n2025.07.25 18:19:10 Error      -  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\nSystem.NullReferenceException: Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.PhysBoneManager.OutputFullDebug () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.PhysBoneManager.ScheduleExecutionJob (Unity.Jobs.JobHandle dependsOn) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at VRC.Dynamics.VRCAvatarDynamicsScheduler.PreScheduleAvatarDynamics (System.Boolean finalizeImmediately) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n...and many more same, repeating NullReferenceException filling up the log.",
